        <obo:IAO_0000118 xml:lang="en">power to methane</obo:IAO_0000118>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">power-to-methane process</rdfs:label>
        <oeo:OEO_00020426>issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/940
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/954

